  "summary": "From sitting on one hip, press up into a side plank with the top arm arching overhead, then lower with control.",
  "steps": [
    "Sit on one hip, knees bent, top foot in front of the bottom foot, hand on the mat a little out from the hip.",
    "Breathe in to press up, straightening the legs, top arm lifting.",
    "Breathe out to arc the top arm overhead and lift the hips higher.",
    "Breathe in to return to the side plank; breathe out to lower."
